    "description": "Once per encounter, you may spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a> to augment your own ability to withstand damage by imbuing the Armor you are wearing with <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Force\" title=\"The Force\">The Force</a>. This allows you to add your Armor bonus to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a> to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Damage_Threshold\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage Threshold\">Damage Threshold</a> until the end of the encounter.",
